// Layer_GitOps_CD — GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer (layer 8 of 9)
// Manual render: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Create a NEW canvas named "Layer_GitOps_CD".
// Export the PNG to materials/reports/figures/Layer_GitOps_CD.png
// Reference: subsec:lapisan-gitops (Section IV.3, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi); tool
//   detail for the layer in row 8 of tab:layanan_industri. Included as fig:layer-gitops.
// Focus: the chain Gitea > Tekton > image registry > Argo CD reconciles all
//   Platform Applications, Argo Rollouts as the progressive delivery operator.
// Icons: product logos from docs.eraser.io/docs/icons (checked 2026-07-11): git,
//   docker (registry:2 = Docker Distribution), argo, kubernetes; the rest generic.
// Rendering MUST be horizontal (direction right), at most two rows of nodes per group,
//   without \rotatebox in LaTeX.
// Layer basis: the group label carries its source category (najafabadi2024analysis),
//   namely the CI/CD category.
// Implementation check: gitops/gitea, gitops/tekton, common/registry,
//   gitops/argo-cd, gitops/argo-rollouts.

direction right

// Change actor (boundary)
Platform Team [icon: users, color: gray, label: "Platform Team (configuration authors)"]

// GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer
GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer [icon: git-branch, color: blue, label: "GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer (CI/CD category)"] {
  Gitea [icon: git, label: "Gitea (internal Git)"]
  Tekton [icon: settings, label: "Tekton (CI + build)"]
  Registry [icon: docker, label: "Image Registry (registry:2)"]
  Argo CD [icon: argo, label: "Argo CD (GitOps CD)"]
  Argo Rollouts [icon: argo, label: "Argo Rollouts (progressive delivery)"]
}

// Reconciliation targets (boundary)
Kubernetes [icon: kubernetes, color: gray, label: "Kubernetes (k3s)"]
Platform Applications [icon: layers, color: gray, label: "Platform Applications (all layers)"]

// GitOps flow
Platform Team > Gitea: manifest commit
Gitea > Tekton: CI webhook
Tekton > Registry: build and push image
Tekton > Gitea: image tag commit
Gitea > Argo CD: manifest source
Argo CD > Kubernetes: declarative sync
Argo CD > Platform Applications: Application reconciliation
Argo Rollouts > Platform Applications: progressive delivery
Registry > Kubernetes: image pull
